    {"Assertion":"sediment-survives-a-thin","sentence":"sediment survives a thin session — a pooled track keeps its earned rank even when this session has not yet re-mirrored the holder who has it, so a reload cannot evict what nothing currently contradicts"}
    {"Assertion":"and-eviction-still-fires","sentence":"and eviction still fires for cause — a genuinely better-ranked arrival still crowds out the worst of the sediment, never the better-ranked tracks beside it"}
